	<section_number>38.2-2109</section_number>
	<catch_line>Execution of policies</catch_line>
	<text>
		The policy shall be executed by the proper officers of the insurer or insurers, whose signatures on the policy may be in facsimile.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 38-179; 1950, p. 993; 1952, c. 317, § 38.1-368; 1977, c. 313; 1986, c. 562.</history>
</law>
